{"id":"50ccecf2bfaccddf","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-thm-levy-itodecomposition.md","title":"Lévy–Itô Decomposition","display":"thm-levy-itodecomposition — Lévy–Itô Decomposition","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-itodecomposition","aliases":["58-thm-levy-itodecomposition"],"display":"thm-levy-itodecomposition — Lévy–Itô Decomposition","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-brownian.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-itodecomposition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-itodecomposition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-itodecomposition — Lévy–Itô Decomposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0a20d5f74408674\" href=\"?note=d0a20d5f74408674\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md\">../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fc074624288fbbb\" href=\"?note=8fc074624288fbbb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-brownian.md\">../batch15/58-df-brownian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8a6696125be20e0d\" href=\"?note=8a6696125be20e0d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md\">../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e36ff0da02f94e7a\" href=\"?note=e36ff0da02f94e7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md\">../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,b,\\sigma,\\nu,B,N,\\widetilde N\\in V\">\\(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,b,\\sigma,\\nu,B,N,\\widetilde N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\times(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\})\">\\(E=\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\times(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\})\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})\\otimes\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\})\">\\(\\mathcal E=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0})\\otimes\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{0\\})\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Brownian}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S:V^7\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8a6696125be20e0d\" href=\"?note=8a6696125be20e0d\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md\">../batch16/58-df-poisson-random-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e36ff0da02f94e7a\" href=\"?note=e36ff0da02f94e7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md\">../batch11/58-df-levy-canonical.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}ito\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\n\\exists\\nu,B,N,\\widetilde N\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S\n(N,ds\\otimes\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\widetilde N=N-ds\\otimes\\nu\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\geq0\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX_t=bt+\\sigma B_t\n+\\int_{(0,t]\\times\\{0&lt;|x|&lt;1\\}}x\\,\\widetilde N(ds,dx)\n+\\int_{(0,t]\\times\\{|x|\\geq1\\}}x\\,N(ds,dx)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}ito\\text{-}decomposition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LevyProcess}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,1)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\exists b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\n\\exists\\nu,B,N,\\widetilde N\\in V\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{LevyMeasure}_S(\\nu,1)\n\\land\\mathrm{Brownian}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{PoissonRandomMeasure}_S\n(N,ds\\otimes\\nu,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,E,\\mathcal E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\widetilde N=N-ds\\otimes\\nu\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall t\\geq0\\;\n\\Bigl(\nX_t=bt+\\sigma B_t\n+\\int_{(0,t]\\times\\{0&lt;|x|&lt;1\\}}x\\,\\widetilde N(ds,dx)\n+\\int_{(0,t]\\times\\{|x|\\geq1\\}}x\\,N(ds,dx)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every Lévy process decomposes into drift, Brownian, small jumps, and large jumps.</li>\n<li>This is the structure theorem for Lévy processes.</li>\n<li>The Lévy-process and Poisson-random-measure predicates now use their full upstream signatures, including the underlying probability and jump spaces.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-levy-process.md","status":"resolved","id"